// Creates a Bloom filter for membership tests at scale. A Bloom filter answers
// "have we seen this IOC?" in constant memory but cannot return context.
//
// Docs:
//   https://tenzir.com/docs/reference/operators/context_create_bloom_filter
//   https://tenzir.com/docs/explanations/enrichment
context_create_bloom_filter "misp_ioc_filter", capacity=1000000, fp_probability=0.001
